    [x] AL-12: Update feature documentation and proposal status.
        Depends: AL-08, AL-09, AL-10, AL-11.
        Document hold-to-loot, client-only installation, settings, eligibility,
        overflow behavior, and the distinction from harvesting.
        Update the proposal to match implemented decisions.
        Record the tested game version and any remaining compatibility limits.
        Completed: README documents the gesture, optional client ConfigLib,
